<title>USA: Specialty Catalog chair has 8.2 pct stake.</title>
<headline>Specialty Catalog chair has 8.2 pct stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steven Brock, chairman and chief executive officer of Specialty Catalog, said Monday he holds an 8.2 percent stake in the company or 410,160 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Brock said his latest transactions include the purchase of 1,000 common shares bought in the company's initial public offering on Oct 17 for $6.50 per share.</p>
</text>
